title: Deleting a file while another one has unsaved text takes its card and its row away all the same (look at the pictures: b.txt must be gone)
folders: edit-odd
limit: 50
absent-file: edit-odd/b.txt
forbid-log: nothing offers
expect-log: updated 'b\.txt' \(deleted\) alone in
expect-file: edit-odd/a.txt :: (?-i)\AMINEfirst of a\n

wait 3000
left files
goto a.txt
wait 800
edit a.txt 1 1
type MINE
delete b.txt
wait 600
answer Delete
wait 3500
mark b-deleted-a-unsaved
wait 400
key save
wait 3500
mark after-save
wait 400
quit
